{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/010-ru-fen/wangli-yundu","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/010-ru-fen/wangli-yundu/data.json","title":"詩經韻讀 · 汝墳 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 周南 · 汝墳 · 汇集《詩經韻讀》关于《汝墳》的 4 条 annotation，含 4 条 gloss。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"010-ru-fen","materialId":"wangli-yundu"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/010-ru-fen/wangli-yundu","poem":{"id":"010-ru-fen","title":"汝墳","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhounan","path":["風","周南","汝墳"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"遵彼汝墳","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"伐其條枚","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"未見君子","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"惄如調飢","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"遵彼汝墳","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"伐其條肄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"既見君子","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"不我遐棄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"魴魚赬尾","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"王室如燬","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"雖則如燬","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"父母孔邇","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"《汝墳》韵读段","targetNotes":"书页 146-147 上整段韵读说明。","sourceLabel":"第 146 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-1.png 与 /tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-2.png 共覆盖《汝墳》全段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"整段沿用本书韵读格式，为《汝墳》三章逐句标拟音与韵部；首章以“陽、陽、之”三部相间，次章标“肄”与“棄”的音读，末章则列“燬”“邇”的对应部类，显示王力把三章都视作四句一转的节奏。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"遵彼汝墳，伐其條枚。未見君子，惄如調飢。","targetNotes":"首章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 146 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-1.png 下半。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"首章标“陽(jiang)”与“邊(huang)”为阳部，“君子(tzia)”与“歸裁(tzo)”归之部，显示王力把“惄如調飢”读作与前章相谐的复沓收束。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"遵彼汝墳，伐其條肄。既見君子，不我遐棄。","targetNotes":"第二章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 146 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-1.png 末段续至 /tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-2.png 页首。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"第二章把“肄”与“邊处”的读法分别归入鱼、职等部，而“君子”“遐棄”仍延续前章的之部收束，显示这一章在韵脚上与首章相承而变其二句。","notes":null}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"魴魚赬尾，王室如燬。雖則如燬，父母孔邇。","targetNotes":"第三章韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 147 页局部","sourceNotes":"/tmp/rufen-pages/wangli-more-2.png 上段；下半已转《摽有梅》。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读","text":"第三章列“燬(siek)”“邇(hea)”等拟音，并把“父母孔邇”与前句对应成同一结穴，可见王力把末章读成由鱼、职转入歌部的收尾。","notes":null}]}]}}}
